{"type":"text","timestamp":1789176434061,"sessionID":"ses_f6cc93210ffe9H1hIXSpbf64zZ","part":{"id":"prt_09339b67e001Dr6Lc2jH0mspqI","messageID":"msg_09339b099001w1dt2ZLO5FJ01J","sessionID":"ses_f6cc93210ffe9H1hIXSpbf64zZ","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes while keeping caching enabled.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads now require membership in the project’s owning organization. Updates use the same check before modifying storage. List authorization remains before cache access, so cached results cannot bypass membership checks.\n- **Cache isolation:** List keys include an encoded organization ID and retain all existing pagination and sorting parameters.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the affected organization, leaving unrelated organizations’ cached lists usable.\n- **Compatibility:** Existing API signatures, response shapes, and status-code conventions are unchanged.\n\nAdded four regression tests covering unauthorized access without mutation, organization switching, membership revocation with cached results, all-variant invalidation, unrelated cache reuse, and organization-prefix boundaries.\n\n**Verification**\n- `npm test`: all 12 tests passed, including all 8 existing tests.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- No existing tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789176428158,"end":1789176434060},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_040ba894f2dc9e86016aa4aa6c255887d1be68ede991434a7c","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
